OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the Active champions making a
OL,4,Adifference
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Newquay boxing gym and a mens'
OL,7,Fwalking group in Falmouth are in the
OL,8,Frunning for a BBC Radio Cornwall Make a
OL,9,FDifference Award.
OL,11,FThe founder of an ultra-marathon race
OL,12,Fon the Isles of Scilly and a martial
OL,13,Farts gym in Bodmin are also nominated
OL,14,Fin the Active category.
OL,16,FThe award is for an individual or group
OL,17,Fof people who have used physical
OL,18,Factivity or sport as a way of improving
OL,19,Fthe lives of those in their community.
OL,21,FThe winner will be revealed at a
OL,22,Fceremony in Truro this week.
